## 7. Storage Manipulation DoS

```solidity
// VULNERABLE - attacker can fill storage cheaply
function register(string calldata name) external {
    names[msg.sender] = name;  // Unlimited length string
}

// SECURE - limit storage
function register(string calldata name) external {
    require(bytes(name).length <= 32, "Name too long");
    names[msg.sender] = name;
}
```

