## DoS Audit Checklist

- [ ] No unbounded loops over dynamic arrays
- [ ] Pagination available for large operations
- [ ] External call failures don't block critical operations
- [ ] Pull over push for ETH/token distributions
- [ ] Emergency recovery mechanisms for key loss
- [ ] Input sizes bounded
- [ ] Frontrunning-sensitive operations protected
- [ ] State growth is bounded or manageable
